---
description: Git commits must have no co-author or Cursor trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commit messages

When creating or amending commits in this repo:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by`, `Signed-off-by`, `Made-with`, or any other trailer.
- Do **not** attribute commits to Cursor (or any AI tool) in the message body.
- Message body is the subject (and optional human-written description) only.
- If the environment injects a Cursor/`Co-authored-by` trailer, strip it before pushing (e.g. soft-reset + `git commit-tree`, or amend to a clean message). Never leave that trailer on `main`.
